      "text_helper": "Section 14.3.17 \"Timer input XOR function\" in chapter 14 (Advanced-control timers (TIM1 and TIM8)), RM0008 Rev 21, page 332.",
      "section_content": "The TI1S bit in the TIMx_CR2 register, allows the input filter of channel 1 to be connected to\nthe output of a XOR gate, combining the three input pins TIMx_CH1, TIMx_CH2 and\nTIMx_CH3.\nThe XOR output can be used with all the timer input functions such as trigger or input\ncapture. An example of this feature used to interface Hall sensors is given in\nSection14.3.18.",
